# Projects

---

An index for various projects.

{.project-table}
| Projects                    | Status                | Group     | Description                                                                          |
|-----------------------------|-----------------------|-----------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| [ArduinoMDADriver][]        | :evergreen_tree: Done |           | Arduino IBM Monochrome Display Adapter (MDA) library.                                |
| Atoms (GBA)                 | :evergreen_tree: Done | Game      | A GBA port of "Atoms" created by B Hewlett.                                          |
| [Channel-F-Cart-Dumper][]   | :evergreen_tree: Done | Channel F | Allows you to pull software from a Channel F cartridge.                              |
| Digital Piano               | :evergreen_tree: Done |           | Plays songs from text files from [pianoletternotes][].                               |
| Email Games                 | :evergreen_tree: Done | Games     | Players can play various games via email (chess, checkers, etc.)                     |
| FM-API                      | :evergreen_tree: Done |           | Converts files to audio and back (for cassette storage).                             |
| [Fn-Remapper][]             | :evergreen_tree: Done |           | GUI for remapping Lenovo Thinkpad X1 Extreme Gen 5 Function keys.                    |
| Forum File Uploader         | :evergreen_tree: Done |           | Converts files to post text for storage on forums.                                   |
| [HomeLab][]                 | :evergreen_tree: Done |           | My home server setup.                                                                |
| [METAR Map][]               | :evergreen_tree: Done |           | A [METAR map][] of my home state, Florida.                                           |
| [Multi-Menu][]              | :evergreen_tree: Done | Channel F | The main navigation screen of the Flashcart-Pi for the Channel F.                    |
| NCDU to WizTree             | :evergreen_tree: Done |           | A conversion tool to allow [WizTree][] to import output from an [NCDU][] scan.       |
| [Nim-Dictionary][]          | :evergreen_tree: Done |           | A terminal dictionary written in [Nim][].                                            |
| [NTSB-Bot][]                | :evergreen_tree: Done |           | Generates and uploads summary reports from the NTSB aviation accident database.      |
| Portal Terminal Songs       | :evergreen_tree: Done |           | The ending songs to portal, playing in the terminal with ascii animations.           |
| [SNES2ChannelF][]           | :evergreen_tree: Done | Channel F | Interfaces a SNES controller with a Channel F.                                       |
| [Static Site Generator][]   | :seedling: Active     |           | The static site generator used to produce this site.                                 |
| XBOX Modding                | :seedling: Active     |           | Upgrading my old XBOX.                                                               |
| Galactic Conflict           | :chestnut: Inactive   | Game      | A terminal game based on the play-by-mail "Galactic Conflict".                       |
| Homebrew CPU                | :chestnut: Inactive   |           | A series of homebrew CPUs I've designed over the years.                              |
| Pascal Compiler             | :chestnut: Inactive   | Channel F | A compiler for a [Pascal][] language on the Channel F, Epoch, and x86.               |
| [PicoVideocart][]           | :chestnut: Inactive   | Channel F | A [Fairchild Channel F][] [flashcart][], powered by a Raspberry Pi Pico / Teensy 4.  |
| VGA / MDA circuit           | :chestnut: Inactive   |           | A serial device that takes ascii text and displays it on a [VGA][] / [MDA][] screen. |
| [Videocart-Image-Format][]  | :chestnut: Inactive   | Channel F | A Fairchild Channel F game format based on the CCS64 emulator [Cartridge Image][].   |

