## :thought_balloon: Ideas

---

{.project-table}
| Projects               | Description                                      |
|------------------------|--------------------------------------------------|
| Channel F Clone        | Build a Channel F computer from modern parts.    |
| Chip-8 Emulator        | See [Chip-8][].                                  |
| Custom Filesystem      | Explore various filesystem implementations.      |
| Disc Manager           | A tape manager for discs.                        |
| Firearm Laser Training | Mark shots from a dry-fire laser using a camera. |
| Games                  | Various video game ideas.                        |
| MSX1/2 Clone           | Build an MSX computer from modern parts.         |
| Pokekon Flashcart      | Play [Pokekon][] games from an SD card.          |
| Terminal Bookmarks     | Bookmark directories.                            |
| Thermal Typewriter     | Thermal printer + keyboard.                      |
| yt-dlp Jellyfin Plugin | Use [Jellyfin][] to view yt-dlp downloads.       |
| ZX81 Expansion Port    | Build some addons for the ZX-81.                 |

